{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49662","headline":"菩萨蛮 三 · 欧阳炯","name":"菩萨蛮 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠眉双脸新妆薄，幽闺斜卷青罗幕。\n寒食百花时，红繁香满枝。\n双双梁燕语，蝶舞相随去。\n肠断正思君，闲眠冷绣茵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}